# Return from the Wilds, modes 1 and 2: "Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle" and "Create a 1/1 white Human creature
# token" (CR 700.2, 701.23). A Black Lotus pays the {2}{G} exactly; the Island found enters tapped, the library is shuffled once, and the Human is a 1/1 white creature.
# Bot2's Islands stay in Bot2's library: the search is only of Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Return from the Wilds
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Return from the Wilds.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Search(Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Human Token.Colors = White

[Expect]
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
